Hot Desk adds one SCMP_ACT_ALLOW rule for clone and unshare to support
Chromium's user-namespace sandbox. Other rules remain as published upstream.

The image extends trycua/xfce-cua and installs cua-computer-server, Chromium,
Node.js and Playwright MCP, plus Valet when built with HOTDESK_VALET=1. These
components retain their upstream licenses.
